  "translation": "Ni so-minɛn min bɛ ɲɛsan-fɛnsɛn in ɲɛfɛ, min bɛ kɔgɔji sira fan fɛ, a ka gɛrɛgɛrɛcogo ye ɛmɛ tan-ni-wolonfila (70) jɛ; so-minɛn in kɔnɔn ye ɛmɛ tilanan (5) jɛ gɛrɛgɛrɛ, a bɛɛ la kɔrɔn kɔrɔn; a ka tigɛcogo ye ɛmɛ wolonwula-tan (90) jɛ.",
